{"pageid":4256,"title":"Sign Text Formatting","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Sign Text Formatting</span>","revid":20367,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page is for <b>Sign</b> Text Formatting. For <b>Speakers</b>, go to <a href=\"/wiki/Speaker_Text_Formatting\" title=\"Speaker Text Formatting\">Speaker Text Formatting</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"About\">About</span></h2>\n<p>Rich text tags are similar to XML/HTML tags where you must include both an opening and closing tag around the text. These allow you to change the font style, type, color, and more, and allow for more diverse and interesting <a href=\"/wiki/Sign\" title=\"Sign\">Signs</a> on your plot.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Tags_List.5B1.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tags_List[1]\">Tags List<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></h2>\n<p><b><u>Italics:</u></b> <code><b>&lt;i&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/i&gt;</b></code> | Makes text within the tags <i>Italic</i>.\n</p>\n<p><b><u>Fonts:</u> <code>&lt;font Oswald&gt;</code></b><code>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/font&gt;</b></code> | Changes the font of the text. A full list of supported fonts can be found on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://create.roblox.com/docs/reference/engine/datatypes/Font\">Official Roblox Documentation site</a>.</p><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 222px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Rich_text_collage.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107001325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;This is sample text!&quot; with the applied font, italics, color and stroke.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"222\" height=\"149\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rich text collage.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_text_collage.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Rich_text_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/222?cb=20251107001325\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Rich_text_collage.png/revision/latest?cb=20251107001325\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;This is sample text!&quot; with the applied font, italics, color and stroke.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Rich_text_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/222?cb=20251107001325\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"222\" height=\"149\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rich text collage.png\" data-image-key=\"Rich_text_collage.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/df/Rich_text_collage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/222?cb=20251107001325\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rich_text_collage.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">\"This is sample text!\" with the applied font, italics, color and stroke.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><b><u>Color:</u></b> <code><b>&lt;color ff0000&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/color&gt;</b></code> | Changes the text color to <font color=\"ff0000\">Red</font>. Change \"ff0000\" to the HEX code of the color <b>without the pound (#)</b> you wish to use. (For example, 32cd32 for <font color=\"32cd32\">Lime Green</font>.)\n</p><p><b><u>Stroke:</u></b> <code><b>&lt;stroke ff0000&gt;</b>Lorem Ipsum<b>&lt;/stroke&gt;</b></code> | Adds a <span style=\"text-shadow:1px 0px 0px red, -1px 0px 0px red, 0px 1px 0px red, 0px -1px 0px red, 1px 1px 0px red, -1px -1px 0px red, -1px 1px 0px red, 1px -1px 0px red;\"><b>red outline</b></span> to text. As with <b>Color</b>, change \"ff0000\" to the HEX color you want to use.\n</p><p>You can nest multiple tags within each other, as long as the closing tags are in the reverse order. For example, \"<code><b>&lt;font Oswald&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;color ff0000&gt;&lt;stroke 000000&gt;</b>This is sample text!<b>&lt;/stroke&gt;&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;</b></code><b>\"</b> would create \"This is sample text!\" in the Oswald font, italicized, colored red, with a black outline.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Escape_Forms.5B1.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Escape_Forms[1]\">Escape Forms<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-:0&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-:0-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></h2>\n<p>If you want to render certain characters like &lt; or &gt; and exempt them from consideration as part of rich text tags, you can write them in their <b>escape form</b>. Just write the text that's under \"Escape\" and it should convert it to the Character version on signs in the game.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>Table of escape forms, their usages, and outcomes.\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Character\n</th>\n<th>Escape\n</th>\n<th>Example\n</th>\n<th>Result\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;\n</td>\n<td>&amp;lt;\n</td>\n<td>x <b>&amp;lt;</b> y\n</td>\n<td>x &lt; y\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;\n</td>\n<td>&amp;gt;\n</td>\n<td>x <b>&amp;gt;</b> y\n</td>\n<td>y &gt; x\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\"\n</td>\n<td>&amp;quot;\n</td>\n<td><b>&amp;quot;</b>x<b>&amp;quot;</b>\n</td>\n<td>\"x\"\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>'\n</td>\n<td>&amp;apos;\n</td>\n<td><b>&amp;apos;</b>xyz<b>&amp;apos;</b>\n</td>\n<td>'xyz'\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&amp;\n</td>\n<td>&amp;amp;\n</td>\n<td>yes <b>&amp;amp;</b> no\n</td>\n<td>yes &amp; no\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Rich text tags like Bold (<code>&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;</code>), Underline (<code>&lt;u&gt;&lt;/u&gt;</code>), and Strikethrough (<code>&lt;s&gt;&lt;/s&gt;</code>) have been tested and unfortunately <b>do not work.</b>\n<ul><li>Rich text tags that start with Font (such as <code>&lt;font transparency=\"#\"&gt;&lt;/font&gt;</code>) will not work, as the game only reads the word <b>font</b> at the beginning and assumes it's for a font face.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If a rich text tag doesn't work in a sign, it will disappear from the text box entirely when confirmed.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"b304ff639a0ec5733980362c404d03d3\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px; top:2px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag.png\" title=\"Text Formating with Italic Tag.png (503 KB)\" style=\"height:146px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107002019\" title=\"Text Formating with Italic Tag.png (503 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Italics\" height=\"150\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Text Formating with Italic Tag.png\" data-image-key=\"Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Italics\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Text Formating with Italic Tag.png (503 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Italics\" height=\"150\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Text Formating with Italic Tag.png\" data-image-key=\"Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Italics\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5f/Text_Formating_with_Italic_Tag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107002019\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Italics</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:152px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:146px; width:185px; top:2px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag.png\" title=\"Text Formating with Font Tag.png (482 KB)\" style=\"height:146px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a0/Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107001948\" title=\"Text Formating with Font Tag.png (482 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Oswald Font\" height=\"150\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Text Formating with Font Tag.png\" data-image-key=\"Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Oswald Font\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Text Formating with Font Tag.png (482 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Oswald Font\" height=\"150\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Text Formating with Font Tag.png\" data-image-key=\"Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Oswald Font\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a0/Text_Formating_with_Font_Tag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20251107001948\" /></a></div></div><div cla